---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Dennis Klincov · Beratungs-Mandate auf Einladung">

  <!-- ============ HERO MIT VIDEO ============ -->
  <section class="parallax">
    <div class="parallax-visuals">
      <div class="hero-bg" data-parallax-bg>
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/images/Dionysus.jpeg">
          <source src="/videos/Dionysus-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-glows"></div>

      <span class="float-dot" style="top: 18%; left: 8%; animation-delay: 0.3s;"></span>
      <span class="float-dot" style="top: 28%; right: 12%; animation-delay: 1.1s;"></span>
      <span class="float-dot" style="bottom: 32%; left: 18%; animation-delay: 2.4s;"></span>
      <span class="float-dot" style="bottom: 22%; right: 24%; animation-delay: 3.2s;"></span>
      <span class="float-dot" style="top: 55%; left: 4%; animation-delay: 1.8s;"></span>

      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-headline-wrap">
          <h1 class="display hero-headline">
            <span class="word-animate" data-delay="300">Mandant</span><br>
            <em><span class="word-animate" data-delay="500">werden.</span></em>
          </h1>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-action">
          <p class="lead word-animate" data-delay="1200">
            Beratungs-Praxis von Dennis Klincov. Selektiver Mandantenstamm. Erstgespräche werden nach Prüfung der Anfrage vergeben.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-action-buttons">
            <a href="#bewerbung" class="btn-gold btn-gold-large word-animate" data-delay="1400">
              Mandant werden
              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </a>
            <a href="#gruende" class="btn-outline-gold word-animate" data-delay="1500">
              Warum Dennis Klincov
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-action-meta word-animate" data-delay="1600">
            Antwort innerhalb von zehn Werktagen
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="parallax-fade"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ DREI GRÜNDE ============ -->
  <section class="standard gruende" id="gruende">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Warum Dennis Klincov</span>
        <h2 class="monumental">Drei Gründe. <em>Nicht mehr.</em></h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Wer Beratungs-Mandanten sucht, findet hundert Berater. Wer eine Beratungs-Praxis sucht, die jedes Thema regulatorisch und operativ vollständig durchdrungen hat, findet drei.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="gruende-grid">
        <article class="grund">
          <div class="nummer">01</div>
          <h3>Markttiefe in zwei Feldern, nicht Breite in zehn.</h3>
          <p>bAV in allen fünf Durchführungswegen, Vorstandsversorgung mit allen steuerlichen Konsequenzen, D&amp;O mit Branchen- und Gesellschaftsform-Spezifika. Andere Themen werden nur betreten, wenn die nötige Tiefe nachgeholt werden kann. Diese Disziplin ist die Eintrittshürde, nicht die Begrenzung.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="grund">
          <div class="nummer">02</div>
          <h3>Skin in the Game statt PowerPoint-Strategie.</h3>
          <p>Empfehlungen werden begründet, nicht behauptet. Die Reputation hängt am Mandat-Ergebnis, nicht am Pitch-Deck. Honorarbasis bedeutet: keine Provisionsmotivation, keine versteckte Produktagenda. Jede Empfehlung trifft auch Dennis Klincov selbst.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="grund">
          <div class="nummer">03</div>
          <h3>Selektiver Mandantenstamm, nicht Mandantenzahl.</h3>
          <p>Wachstum geschieht über Empfehlung aus dem bestehenden Stamm, nicht über Akquise-Sprints. Die Mandatszahl bleibt überschaubar, damit jedes Mandat die nötige Tiefe bekommt. Wer aufgenommen wird, bekommt ungeteilte Aufmerksamkeit.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ERFAHRUNGSLEISTE ============ -->
  <section class="standard erfahrung" id="erfahrung">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Zehn Jahre Praxis</span>
        <h2 class="monumental">Erfahrungs-<em>Leiste.</em></h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Die Beratungs-Praxis von Dennis Klincov hat sich seit 2014 schrittweise vertieft. Felder werden hinzugenommen, nachdem die nötige Markttiefe nachgeholt wurde.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline" id="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        <div class="timeline-row">
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span class="jahr">2014</span>
            <h4>Wirtschafts-Informatik</h4>
            <p>Bachelor-Studium als technisch-analytische Grundlage</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span class="jahr">2019</span>
            <h4>bAV-Firma</h4>
            <p>Mitgründung einer auf bAV spezialisierten Gesellschaft</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span class="jahr">2020</span>
            <h4>Wirtschafts-Wissenschaften</h4>
            <p>Vertiefung der wirtschaftlichen und bilanziellen Tiefe</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span class="jahr">2021</span>
            <h4>bAV-Experte</h4>
            <p>Geprüfter Status in allen fünf Durchführungswegen</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span class="jahr">2022</span>
            <h4>Probonio</h4>
            <p>Begleitung der Gründung als externer Sparring-Partner</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span class="jahr">2024</span>
            <h4>bKV-Experte</h4>
            <p>Geprüfter Status für die betriebliche Krankenversicherung</p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item upcoming">
            <div class="dot"></div>
            <span class="jahr">2027</span>
            <h4>Underwriter</h4>
            <p>Zertifizierung in Vorbereitung für die Risiko-Beurteilungs-Ebene</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ PULL QUOTE ============ -->
  <section class="compact pull-section" id="pullSection">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <blockquote class="pull-quote">
        <span class="word-animate">Diskretion</span>
        <span class="word-animate">ist</span>
        <span class="word-animate">Berufs-Verständnis,</span>
        <br>
        <em>
          <span class="word-animate">nicht</span>
          <span class="word-animate">Marketing.</span>
        </em>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SCHWERPUNKTE MIT 3D-TILT ============ -->
  <section class="standard schwerpunkte" id="schwerpunkte">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Zwei Felder, in Tiefe gepflegt</span>
        <h2 class="monumental">Beratungs-<em>Schwerpunkte.</em></h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Seit zehn Jahren in zwei Themenkreisen. Beide werden regulatorisch und operativ vollständig durchdrungen, bevor empfohlen wird.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="schwerpunkt-grid">
        <article class="schwerpunkt-card" data-tilt>
          <div class="head">
            <span class="num">I</span>
            <h3>Corporate Benefits</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Betriebliche Vorsorge und Versorgung für mittelständische Unternehmen. Alle fünf Durchführungswege der bAV, betriebliche Krankenversicherung mit Bilanzwirkung, BGM als gestaltbarer Hebel.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>bAV in allen fünf Durchführungswegen (Direktzusage, Unterstützungskasse, Pensionsfonds, Direktversicherung, Pensionskasse)</li>
            <li>bKV mit Auswahlsystematik und Tarifvergleich</li>
            <li>BGM als steuerlich strukturierter Hebel</li>
            <li>Versorgungsordnungen, Anpassung an aktuelle Rechtslage</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
        <article class="schwerpunkt-card" data-tilt>
          <div class="head">
            <span class="num">II</span>
            <h3>Executive Compensation &amp; Risk</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Vorstands- und Geschäftsführungs-Versorgung, Tantiemen-Strukturen, dazu die Haftungsabsicherung der handelnden Personen. Mit steuerlicher und bilanzieller Konsequenz.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Vorstandsversorgung mit Konsequenzen aus <code>§ 6a EStG</code></li>
            <li>Tantiemen-Modelle mit Umwandlungs-Strategien</li>
            <li>D&amp;O mit Selbstbehalt nach <code>§ 93 AktG</code></li>
            <li>VSH und Cyber für die Geschäftsführungs-Ebene</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ DIONYSUS — Ein Wort zum Namen ============ -->
  <section class="standard dionysus" id="dionysus">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Ein Wort zum Namen</span>
        <h2 class="monumental">Dennis. <em>Dionysus.</em></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="dionysus-statement">
        <p class="statement-text">
          Mein Name leitet sich von <em>Dionysus</em> ab. Gott des Weines, der Freude, der Fruchtbarkeit. So verstehe ich Beratung. Ich säe Strategie. Ich bringe Fruchtbarkeit in die Konzeption. Wir ernten gemeinsam den Wein.
        </p>
        <div class="statement-credit">
          <span class="mono-name">Dennis Klincov</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="orbital-container" id="dionysusOrbital">
        <div class="orbital-stage">
          <div class="orbital-orbit"></div>
          <div class="orbital-center">
            <div class="orbital-core"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="orbital-node" data-index="0">
            <div class="node-glow"></div>
            <div class="node-circle">I</div>
            <div class="node-label">Säen</div>
            <div class="node-detail">
              <div class="detail-meta">
                <span class="detail-status">Akt I</span>
                <span class="detail-sub">Strategie</span>
              </div>
              <h4>Säen</h4>
              <p>Am Anfang eines Mandats steht die Konzeption. Was sind die Strukturen, was die Hebel, was die Risiken? Die Strategie wird mit Sorgfalt ausgebracht. Nicht schnell, sondern richtig.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="orbital-node" data-index="1">
            <div class="node-glow"></div>
            <div class="node-circle">II</div>
            <div class="node-label">Pflegen</div>
            <div class="node-detail">
              <div class="detail-meta">
                <span class="detail-status">Akt II</span>
                <span class="detail-sub">Fruchtbarkeit</span>
              </div>
              <h4>Pflegen</h4>
              <p>Fruchtbarkeit kommt nicht von selbst. Die operative Begleitung über Jahre macht aus einer Konzeption ein Versorgungswerk, das trägt. Mandate werden gepflegt, nicht abgewickelt.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="orbital-node" data-index="2">
            <div class="node-glow"></div>
            <div class="node-circle">III</div>
            <div class="node-label">Ernten</div>
            <div class="node-detail">
              <div class="detail-meta">
                <span class="detail-status">Akt III</span>
                <span class="detail-sub">Wein</span>
              </div>
              <h4>Ernten</h4>
              <p>Am Ende wird gemeinsam geerntet. Vermögen, Vorsorge, Sicherheit. Wein ist das Symbol: gereift, gemeinsam genossen. Mandate sind Reifeprozesse über Jahre.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="orbital-hint">Klick auf einen Akt für Details</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ BEWERBUNG mit Netlify Forms ============ -->
  <section class="standard bewerbung" id="bewerbung">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bewerbung-grid">
        <div class="bewerbung-text">
          <h2 class="monumental">Mandant <em>werden.</em></h2>
          <p>
            Wer eine Beratungs-Anfrage einreicht, bekommt innerhalb von zehn Werktagen eine Antwort: entweder ein Erstgespräch, oder den Hinweis, dass das Anliegen besser an anderer Stelle aufgehoben ist. Aufgenommen wird, wer in den Schwerpunkten der Praxis von Dennis Klincov liegt und wo die nötige Tiefe einen Unterschied macht.
          </p>
          <p>
            Erstgespräche sind kostenfrei und vertraulich. 30 Minuten. Bringen Sie einen konkreten Anlass mit, nicht den Wunsch nach einer Vorstellung.
          </p>
          <div class="prozess">
            <div class="schritt">
              <div>
                <h4>Anfrage einreichen</h4>
                <p>Knapp, mit konkretem Anlass. Keine Pitch-Vorstellung erforderlich.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="schritt">
              <div>
                <h4>Prüfung innerhalb von zehn Werktagen</h4>
                <p>Sie erhalten eine ehrliche Rückmeldung, ob ein Mandat sinnvoll ist.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="schritt">
              <div>
                <h4>Erstgespräch, falls zustande kommt</h4>
                <p>30 Minuten, kostenfrei, vertraulich, mit klarer nächster Empfehlung.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form
          class="form-card on-light"
          name="bewerbung"
          method="POST"
          data-netlify="true"
          data-netlify-honeypot="bot-field"
          action="/danke/"
        >
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="bewerbung" />
          <p class="hp-field"><label>Bitte leer lassen: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>

          <span class="form-eyebrow">Anfrage einreichen</span>
          <h3>Mandats-Anfrage</h3>
          <p class="form-intro">Pflichtfelder mit Stern. Antwort innerhalb von zehn Werktagen.</p>

          <div class="form-row two">
            <div>
              <label class="label" for="name">Name<span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input class="input" id="name" name="name" type="text" required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="label" for="position">Position<span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input class="input" id="position" name="position" type="text" placeholder="z.B. Geschäftsführung, CFO" required />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-row two">
            <div>
              <label class="label" for="firma">Unternehmen<span class="req">*</span></label>
              <input class="input" id="firma" name="firma" type="text" required />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="label" for="branche">Branche</label>
              <input class="input" id="branche" name="branche" type="text" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <label class="label" for="email">Email<span class="req">*</span></label>
            <input class="input" id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="ihre@firma.de" required />
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <label class="label" for="thema">Beratungsfeld<span class="req">*</span></label>
            <select class="select" id="thema" name="thema" required>
              <option value="">Bitte wählen</option>
              <option value="bav">Betriebliche Altersvorsorge</option>
              <option value="vorstand">Vorstandsversorgung</option>
              <option value="risk">D&amp;O · VSH · Cyber</option>
              <option value="bkv">Betriebliche Krankenversicherung</option>
              <option value="mehrere">Mehrere Felder</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="form-row">
            <label class="label" for="anlass">Konkreter Anlass<span class="req">*</span></label>
            <textarea class="textarea" id="anlass" name="anlass" placeholder="Knapp und konkret. Beispiel: Ablösung einer Direktzusage aus 2006, Pensionsrückstellung 1.3 Mio EUR, Steuerberater bereits eingebunden." required></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="form-submit">
            <button type="submit" class="form-submit-btn">
              Mandats-Anfrage absenden
              <span class="arrow">→</span>
            </button>
            <p class="form-meta">Antwort innerhalb von zehn Werktagen · mail@dennis-klincov.com</p>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ====== SHINY BUTTON ====== */
  .btn-gold {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    padding: 20px 40px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-300) 0%, var(--gold-500) 100%);
    color: var(--wine-deep);
    border: 1px solid var(--gold-700);
    cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; justify-content: center;
    transition: all 250ms var(--ease-editorial);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.35), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
  }
  .btn-gold::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: -75%; width: 50%; height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5), transparent);
    animation: shiny-sweep 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .btn-gold:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-100) 0%, var(--gold-300) 100%);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.5), 0 0 60px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.3);
  }
  .btn-gold .arrow { transition: transform 200ms var(--ease-editorial); color: var(--wine-deep); }
  .btn-gold:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .btn-gold-large { padding: 24px 48px; font-size: 17px; }

  .btn-outline-gold {
    font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    padding: 19px 28px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(20, 8, 15, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    color: var(--gold-300);
    border: 1px solid var(--gold-500);
    cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
    transition: all 200ms var(--ease-editorial);
  }
  .btn-outline-gold:hover {
    background: rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.15);
    color: var(--gold-100); border-color: var(--gold-300);
  }

  /* ====== HERO ====== */
  .parallax {
    position: relative; width: 100%; min-height: 110vh; overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--wine-deepest);
  }
  .parallax-visuals { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 110vh; }

  .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-bg video, .hero-bg img {
    width: 100%; height: 115%;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: center;
    opacity: 0.88;
    filter: brightness(0.78) contrast(1.08) saturate(1.05);
  }
  .hero-bg::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 100% 80% at 30% 50%, transparent 0%, rgba(10,4,8,0.55) 75%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,8,15,0.30) 0%, rgba(10,4,8,0.85) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-glows { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 2; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-glows::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 40%; left: 20%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 60%; height: 70%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,169,97,0.20) 0%, transparent 60%);
    filter: blur(50px);
  }
  .hero-glows::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    bottom: -10%; right: -10%; width: 55%; height: 70%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(91,44,111,0.45) 0%, transparent 65%);
    filter: blur(60px);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    position: relative; z-index: 3;
    width: 100%; max-width: 1440px; height: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 56px 80px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-headline-wrap { grid-column: 1 / span 8; grid-row: 1; align-self: center; }
  h1.display.hero-headline {
    margin: 0; text-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(10, 4, 8, 0.6);
  }
  .hero-action {
    grid-column: 8 / span 5; grid-row: 1;
    align-self: center; justify-self: end;
    max-width: 380px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(31,13,24,0.55) 0%, rgba(10,4,8,0.55) 100%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(1.2);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(1.2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .hero-action .lead {
    font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-on-dark);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .hero-action-buttons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .hero-action-buttons .btn-gold,
  .hero-action-buttons .btn-outline-gold { width: 100%; }
  .hero-action-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text-on-dark-faint); letter-spacing: 1.4px;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center;
    padding-top: 4px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
  }

  .parallax-fade {
    position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 120px; z-index: 4;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, var(--wine-deepest) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; padding: 100px 24px 60px; }
    .hero-headline-wrap { grid-column: 1; }
    .hero-action { grid-column: 1; justify-self: stretch; max-width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-bg video { display: none; }
    .hero-bg { background: var(--wine-deep); }
    .btn-gold::before { animation: none; opacity: 0.1; }
  }

  /* ====== SECTIONS ====== */
  section.standard { padding: 144px 0; position: relative; }
  section.compact { padding: 88px 0; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    section.standard { padding: 88px 0; }
    section.compact { padding: 56px 0; }
  }
  .section-head { max-width: 880px; margin-bottom: 96px; }
  .section-head .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .section-head p.lead { margin-top: 28px; }

  /* ====== DREI GRÜNDE ====== */
  .gruende { background: var(--wine); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .gruende::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: -10%; right: -5%; width: 60%; height: 70%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,169,97,0.10) 0%, transparent 55%);
    filter: blur(80px); pointer-events: none;
  }
  .gruende::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    bottom: -10%; left: -10%; width: 60%; height: 70%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(91,44,111,0.30) 0%, transparent 60%);
    filter: blur(60px); pointer-events: none;
  }
  .gruende .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .gruende-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
  }
  .grund {
    padding: 72px 44px; position: relative;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
    transition: background 400ms var(--ease-editorial);
  }
  .grund::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: -1px; left: 0; width: 0; height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-500), var(--gold-300));
    transition: width 400ms var(--ease-editorial);
  }
  .grund:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .grund:hover { background: rgba(244, 237, 224, 0.03); }
  .grund:hover::after { width: 100%; }
  .grund .nummer {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 56px; line-height: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-300), var(--gold-500));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 36px; letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .grund h3 {
    font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--marble); margin-bottom: 24px;
    min-height: 140px; font-weight: 500;
  }
  .grund p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--text-on-dark-mute); line-height: 1.75; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .gruende-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .grund { border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark); padding: 56px 32px; }
    .grund:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .grund h3 { min-height: auto; }
  }

  /* ====== ERFAHRUNGSLEISTE ====== */
  .erfahrung { background: var(--wine-deep); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .erfahrung::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 30%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 80%; height: 60%;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(201,169,97,0.08) 0%, transparent 65%);
    filter: blur(80px); pointer-events: none;
  }
  .erfahrung .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .timeline { position: relative; padding: 24px 0; }
  .timeline-line {
    position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 22px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold-500) 10%, var(--gold-500) 90%, transparent);
    transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left;
    transition: transform 1400ms var(--ease-emphasized);
  }
  .timeline.revealed .timeline-line { transform: scaleX(1); }
  .timeline-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .timeline-item {
    position: relative; padding-top: 44px; text-align: center;
    opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 600ms var(--ease-subtle), transform 600ms var(--ease-subtle);
  }
  .timeline-item.revealed { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .timeline-item .dot {
    position: absolute; top: 14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold-500);
    border: 3px solid var(--wine-deep);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold-500), 0 0 20px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.5);
    transition: transform 300ms var(--ease-editorial), box-shadow 300ms var(--ease-editorial);
  }
  .timeline-item.upcoming .dot {
    background: var(--wine-elev-2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold-500);
  }
  .timeline-item:hover .dot {
    transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.3);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--gold-300), 0 0 30px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.8);
  }
  .timeline-item .jahr {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-500); margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-gold); border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .timeline-item.upcoming .jahr {
    color: var(--text-on-dark-faint); border-color: var(--border-on-dark);
  }
  .timeline-item h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 18px; color: var(--marble); margin: 8px 0 8px;
    line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .timeline-item p {
    font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-on-dark-mute); line-height: 1.55;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .timeline-row { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 40px 24px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .timeline-line { display: none; }
    .timeline-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .timeline-item { text-align: left; padding-top: 0; padding-left: 32px; }
    .timeline-item .dot { top: 6px; left: 6px; transform: none; }
    .timeline-item:hover .dot { transform: scale(1.3); }
  }

  /* ====== PULL QUOTE ====== */
  .pull-section { background: var(--wine); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .pull-section::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 50%, rgba(201,169,97,0.10) 0%, transparent 65%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pull-section .container-narrow { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .pull-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.8vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1.25; color: var(--marble);
    text-align: center; padding: 24px 0; position: relative;
  }
  .pull-quote em { font-style: italic; }
  .pull-quote .word-animate {
    display: inline-block; opacity: 0; margin: 0 0.15em 0 0;
  }
  .pull-quote em .word-animate {
    font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-300), var(--gold-500));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .pull-quote::before, .pull-quote::after {
    content:''; display: block;
    width: 100px; height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold-500), transparent);
    margin: 0 auto 56px;
    transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: center;
    transition: transform 800ms var(--ease-emphasized);
  }
  .pull-quote::after { margin: 56px auto 0; }
  .pull-section.revealed .pull-quote::before,
  .pull-section.revealed .pull-quote::after { transform: scaleX(1); }

  /* ====== SCHWERPUNKTE ====== */
  .schwerpunkte { background: var(--wine); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .schwerpunkte::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/images/greek-buildings.jpeg');
    background-size: cover; background-position: center;
    opacity: 0.05; filter: blur(3px) hue-rotate(-20deg) saturate(0.5);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .schwerpunkte::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--wine) 0%, rgba(31,13,24,0.92) 50%, var(--wine) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .schwerpunkte .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .schwerpunkt-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px;
    perspective: 1500px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .schwerpunkt-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .schwerpunkt-card {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--wine-elev) 0%, var(--wine-elev-2) 100%);
    padding: 72px 56px; position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transition: transform 300ms var(--ease-editorial), box-shadow 300ms var(--ease-editorial);
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .schwerpunkt-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 60px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.15);
    border-color: var(--gold-500);
  }
  .schwerpunkt-card > * { transform: translateZ(20px); }
  .schwerpunkt-card .head {
    display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 32px; padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
  }
  .schwerpunkt-card .num {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 40px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-300), var(--gold-500));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .schwerpunkt-card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 34px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--marble); font-weight: 500; }
  .schwerpunkt-card p { color: var(--text-on-dark-mute); margin-bottom: 32px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .schwerpunkt-card ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .schwerpunkt-card li {
    position: relative; padding-left: 28px;
    font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-on-dark); line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .schwerpunkt-card li::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0.6em;
    width: 16px; height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-500), transparent);
  }

  /* ====== DIONYSUS ====== */
  .dionysus { background: var(--wine-deep); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .dionysus::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 20%; right: -10%; width: 50%; height: 80%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(91,44,111,0.30) 0%, transparent 65%);
    filter: blur(80px); pointer-events: none;
  }
  .dionysus::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    bottom: -10%; left: -10%; width: 50%; height: 70%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201,169,97,0.10) 0%, transparent 60%);
    filter: blur(80px); pointer-events: none;
  }
  .dionysus .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  .dionysus-statement {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 64px; padding: 88px 64px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--burgundy-deep) 0%, var(--wine) 40%, var(--aubergine) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .dionysus-statement::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/images/Dionysus.jpeg');
    background-size: cover; background-position: center 25%;
    opacity: 0.32; filter: contrast(1.1);
    mix-blend-mode: lighten;
    pointer-events: none; border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .dionysus-statement::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(74,26,36,0.78) 0%, rgba(31,13,24,0.70) 50%, rgba(61,27,64,0.78) 100%);
    pointer-events: none; border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .dionysus-statement > * { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .statement-text {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.35; color: var(--marble);
    max-width: 880px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .statement-text em {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-300), var(--gold-500));
    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
  }
  .statement-credit {
    margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark-strong);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
  }
  .statement-credit::before {
    content: ''; width: 32px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold-500);
  }
  .statement-credit .mono-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-300);
  }

  /* ====== ORBITAL TIMELINE ====== */
  .orbital-container {
    position: relative; width: 100%; height: 720px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    perspective: 1200px;
  }
  .orbital-stage {
    position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .orbital-orbit {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    width: 440px; height: 440px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.15);
    border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .orbital-orbit::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    width: 340px; height: 340px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.08);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .orbital-center {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 76px; height: 76px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--gold-300) 0%, var(--gold-700) 60%, var(--burgundy-deep) 100%);
    z-index: 10;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.5), 0 0 100px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.2);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    animation: orbital-pulse 3.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .orbital-center::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.5);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: orbital-ping 2.8s ease-out infinite;
  }
  .orbital-center::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: -22px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
    animation: orbital-ping 2.8s ease-out 0.7s infinite;
  }
  .orbital-core {
    width: 34px; height: 34px;
    background: rgba(244, 237, 224, 0.95);
    border-radius: 50%;
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  }
  .orbital-node {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    width: 56px; height: 56px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 700ms ease;
    will-change: transform, opacity;
  }
  .node-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 96px; height: 96px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.40), transparent 65%);
    pointer-events: none; opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 300ms ease;
  }
  .orbital-node:hover .node-glow,
  .orbital-node.active .node-glow { opacity: 1; }
  .node-circle {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 56px; height: 56px;
    background: var(--wine-deep);
    border: 2px solid rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.55);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: var(--marble);
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-style: italic; font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 22px;
    transition: all 350ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
  }
  .orbital-node:hover .node-circle { border-color: var(--gold-300); }
  .orbital-node.active .node-circle {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-300), var(--gold-500));
    color: var(--wine-deep);
    border-color: var(--gold-100);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.5);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.7);
  }
  .node-label {
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%; left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, 12px);
    font-family: var(--font-headline);
    font-weight: 500; font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--marble);
    white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    transition: all 300ms ease;
  }
  .orbital-node.active .node-label {
    color: var(--gold-300); font-size: 24px;
    transform: translate(-50%, 24px);
  }
  .node-detail {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(100% + 70px); left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -10px) scale(0.95);
    width: 340px;
    background: rgba(31, 13, 24, 0.96);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px;
    opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
    transition: all 400ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    z-index: 250; text-align: left;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }
  .orbital-node.active .node-detail {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate(-50%, 0) scale(1);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }
  .node-detail::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: -14px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 1px; height: 14px;
    background: var(--gold-500);
  }
  .node-detail .detail-meta {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px; padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
  }
  .node-detail .detail-status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    color: var(--gold-500);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    background: rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .node-detail .detail-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.8px;
    color: var(--text-on-dark-mute);
  }
  .node-detail h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 26px; color: var(--marble);
    margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .node-detail p {
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-on-dark); line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .orbital-hint {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-on-dark-faint);
    letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .dionysus-statement { padding: 56px 32px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .orbital-container { height: 640px; }
    .orbital-orbit { width: 280px; height: 280px; }
    .orbital-orbit::before { width: 210px; height: 210px; }
    .node-detail { width: 280px; padding: 22px; }
  }

  /* ====== BEWERBUNG ====== */
  .bewerbung { background: var(--wine-deepest); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .bewerbung::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/images/white-palace.jpeg');
    background-size: cover; background-position: center;
    opacity: 0.08; filter: blur(2px) hue-rotate(280deg) saturate(0.6);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .bewerbung::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,4,8,0.88) 0%, rgba(20,8,15,0.95) 50%, var(--wine-deepest) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .bewerbung .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .bewerbung-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .bewerbung-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 56px; } }
  .bewerbung-text h2 { margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.8vw, 80px); color: var(--marble); }
  .bewerbung-text p {
    font-size: 17px; color: var(--text-on-dark);
    margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.75; max-width: 480px;
  }
  .prozess { margin-top: 56px; counter-reset: schritt; }
  .schritt {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 24px; padding: 28px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-on-dark);
    counter-increment: schritt;
  }
  .schritt:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .schritt::before {
    content: counter(schritt, decimal-leading-zero);
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--gold-500); letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  .schritt h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 22px; color: var(--marble); margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .schritt p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-on-dark-mute); margin: 0; max-width: none; }

  .form-card {
    background: var(--marble); border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
    padding: 64px 56px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-mythic); position: relative;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .form-card::before {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; width: 100px; height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold-500), var(--gold-300));
  }
  .form-card::after {
    content: ''; position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0; width: 3px; height: 100px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-500), transparent);
  }
  .hp-field { display: none; }
  .form-card .form-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2.2px;
    color: var(--gold-deep); margin-bottom: 16px; display: block;
  }
  .form-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-headline); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 32px; color: var(--wine-deep); margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }
  .form-card .form-intro { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-on-light-mute); margin-bottom: 36px; }
